<#ff6464>TAG TEAM</>
Tag Switch		^X
  Meiling and Sakuya swap places. Ground only.
  Not while the partner is attacking or stunned, or during
  a spell card timer.
Partner Attack		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
  The partner attacks: Sakuya throws knives, Meiling fires
  Fragrant Wave.
  If the partner is hit while attacking she is stunned for
  3 seconds: no partner attacks and no switching.

Combo Assist (during an attack that hit)		^X
  The partner appears beside the opponent and launches them
  so the combo can continue. Uses 1/3 of the MAGIC CIRCUIT
  bar (bottom of the screen), which refills in 18 seconds.

<#ff6464>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Guard Cancel (blocking, 1 bar)		_B_DB_D^A / ^B / ^C
Dash (air too)		_F_F
Back Dash (air too)		_B_B

